Since people already started accurately guessing next release names it's
time to make it a bit complicated.

To select a new name:
- Go to http://www.jarviwiki.fi/wiki/Luokka:Nimi and navigate to the page
  for the lakes starting with the next letter in the alphabet compared
  to current release
- Take the release version of the last release (ignoring hotfixes), and
  the 4 digits; if there already is an RC this version number may be used
  instead.
- Select a starting point in the list. If it's the first time this
  letter is used it'd be the first lake, second time the second, etc.
  Ignore lakes containing spaces, dashes, ...
- Move the sum of the version digits down the list
- If that lake was already taken in the past, go to the next one until
  a free lake comes up


Example:

- 1.0.2.5 Maadajävri
- First lake would be Naakalampi
- Move 8 positions after that
- New release name is Naamankajärvi


Note:

With fast release cycles it's expected to skip one release for naming.
That is, update 8 (1.0.8.x) will most likely get the name from update
6 (1.0.6.x)
